            "documentation": "The relation's two ends, its relata (exactly two); order is meaningless. Each is an entity, a statement or a standalone value document, as `directed_relation`'s `child_id` and `parent_id` may be (Jess Haley, 2026-11-01, did_v2_go_forward_class_audit.md [undirected relation widened]; e.g. the two gene lists of a symmetric gene mapping). Named `entity_id` until [undirected ends are relata] (2026-11-01). Batch check `standalone_value` (report-only first; #73 audit 2 D13): when this names a value document, that document is a STANDALONE value -- not a statement, relation or clock_alignment leaf, all of which are also values.",
